<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises + 3.4 bln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises + 3.4 bln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised more than 3.4 billion dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates were unchanged and bids in million dirhams accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	BID	 AMOUNT	 INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    13 weeks	 50	   50	     7.5  percent</p>
<p>    26 weeks	890	  890	     8.5  percent</p>
<p>    52 weeks	 26.5	 26.5	   9.0  percent</p>
<p>    Two years	 2.75	 2.75	  9.5  percent</p>
<p>    Five years   2,319.5    2,319.5	 10.0  percent</p>
<p>    10 years	 40	   40	    10.25 percent</p>
<p>    15 years	139	  139	    10.50 percent</p>
<p>    Total	  3,467.75   3,467.75</p>
<p>    ($1= 8.7 dirhams)</p>
<p>    --Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
